{"schema_version":1,"generated_utc":"2026-10-15T10:09:43.373939+00:00","source_sha256":"4e416bc03ffc70675df52b411a4929a36303002ed5aff1b72aa882db302e8753","recipe":"float32 arange(elements) + sequence; exact equality; seq starts at zero","scope":["Single producer, single consumer, spawn processes, one acknowledged payload in flight, one fixed shared slot; no pipelining or lock-free claim.","Pipe uses send_bytes/recv_bytes_into with a preallocated receive array, not pickled arrays. Shared mode copies the producer array into shared memory and sends the same sequence/length header over a Pipe. Both return the same sequence/CRC acknowledgement.","Every received tensor is checked by exact value equality against independently generated expected values before acknowledgement. CRC32 is additional accounting, not the sole correctness check.","Measured round trip includes float32 payload generation, producer CRC, shared copy or Pipe transfer, receiver expected-value generation/full validation/CRC and acknowledgement. Overall throughput also includes per-message record keeping. This is not pure transport, a model inference benchmark or a zero-copy end-to-end claim.","Eight identical warmups precede measurement. Fresh processes and alternating mode order are used per pair; startup is excluded. Fixed size order, shared-host interference, allocator state, caches and thermals remain uncontrolled. Finite single-host observations are descriptive, not confidence intervals or universal speedups.","The controller samples producer/consumer RSS sequentially at a requested 5 ms cadence, with actual gaps and read duration retained. Paired RSS can double-count shared pages and miss spikes. Warm baseline, input/reference arrays, record buffers and result serialization are included; controller/resource-tracker memory is excluded. It is not unique physical RAM or total deployment memory.","Workers stay alive after measurement until the controller takes the final sample. The controller closes/unlinks its owned segment after workers exit and probes that its name cannot be reopened. Worker-crash cleanup is tested. Controller kill, machine failure and platform-wide leak freedom are outside this guarantee."],"pairs":4,"count_override":null,"execution_order":[{"payload_bytes":64,"trial":0,"mode":"pipe"},{"payload_bytes":64,"trial":0,"mode":"shared"},{"payload_bytes":64,"trial":1,"mode":"shared"},{"payload_bytes":64,"trial":1,"mode":"pipe"},{"payload_bytes":64,"trial":2,"mode":"pipe"},{"payload_bytes":64,"trial":2,"mode":"shared"},{"payload_bytes":64,"trial":3,"mode":"shared"},{"payload_bytes":64,"trial":3,"mode":"pipe"},{"payload_bytes":1024,"trial":0,"mode":"pipe"},{"payload_bytes":1024,"trial":0,"mode":"shared"},{"payload_bytes":1024,"trial":1,"mode":"shared"},{"payload_bytes":1024,"trial":1,"mode":"pipe"},{"payload_bytes":1024,"trial":2,"mode":"pipe"},{"payload_bytes":1024,"trial":2,"mode":"shared"},{"payload_bytes":1024,"trial":3,"mode":"shared"},{"payload_bytes":1024,"trial":3,"mode":"pipe"},{"payload_bytes":16384,"trial":0,"mode":"pipe"},{"payload_bytes":16384,"trial":0,"mode":"shared"},{"payload_bytes":16384,"trial":1,"mode":"shared"},{"payload_bytes":16384,"trial":1,"mode":"pipe"},{"payload_bytes":16384,"trial":2,"mode":"pipe"},{"payload_bytes":16384,"trial":2,"mode":"shared"},{"payload_bytes":16384,"trial":3,"mode":"shared"},{"payload_bytes":16384,"trial":3,"mode":"pipe"},{"payload_bytes":262144,"trial":0,"mode":"pipe"},{"payload_bytes":262144,"trial":0,"mode":"shared"},{"payload_bytes":262144,"trial":1,"mode":"shared"},{"payload_bytes":262144,"trial":1,"mode":"pipe"},{"payload_bytes":262144,"trial":2,"mode":"pipe"},{"payload_bytes":262144,"trial":2,"mode":"shared"},{"payload_bytes":262144,"trial":3,"mode":"shared"},{"payload_bytes":262144,"trial":3,"mode":"pipe"},{"payload_bytes":1048576,"trial":0,"mode":"pipe"},{"payload_bytes":1048576,"trial":0,"mode":"shared"},{"payload_bytes":1048576,"trial":1,"mode":"shared"},{"payload_bytes":1048576,"trial":1,"m